      "id": "dac-2026-10-26",
      "title": "DAC AoN — capital acquisitions (~₹2.12 lakh Cr)",
      "date": "2026-10-26",
      "amountCr": 212000,
      "indigenousPct": 82,
      "summary": "On 26 Oct 2026 the Defence Acquisition Council (chaired by RM Rajnath Singh) accorded Acceptance of Necessity for capital buys of about ₹2,12,000 Cr across Army, Navy and IAF. ~82% earmarked for Indian industry. AoN is in-principle clearance, not a signed order. Army: HMV, Self-Propelled Tracked Gun (addl. K9 Vajra), GSRS, LMRH, VSHORADS, platform C-UAS, long-range UAS brick, surveillance UAV, Integrated Surveillance & Strike, Long Range Kamikaze Drone. Navy: Active Offboard Decoy System (AODS) + major naval platforms. IAF: helicopters / Special Utility Helicopters, air defence, weapons, Mobile X-Band Doppler Weather Radar.",
      "packages": [
        "High Mobility Vehicles (HMV)",
        "Self-Propelled Tracked Gun System (K9 Vajra)",
        "Gun Shot Response System (GSRS)",
        "Light Multi Role Helicopters (LMRH)",
        "Very Short-Range Air Defence (VSHORADS)",
        "Platform-based Counter-UAS",
        "Long-range UAS / Surveillance UAV / ISSS / Kamikaze drones",
        "Active Offboard Decoy System (AODS)",
        "Major naval platforms",
        "IAF helicopters / Special Utility Helicopters",
        "IAF air defence & weapons",
        "Mobile X-Band Doppler Weather Radar"
      ],
